{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Let there be light.</b> This is the light of the seven days, which served the needs of beings brought into existence without seed; and so it will be in the future, as our Rabbis of blessed memory said (Ketubot, last chapter) — that it will then serve the needs of what is destined to produce levain and silk garments without the power of seed."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:10.518862427Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}